sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Old runner
  participant C as Coordinator
  participant D as Authority store
  participant N as New runner
  C->>O: Pause at safe checkpoint
  O-->>C: Verified checkpoint, no uncertain in-flight action
  C->>D: CAS ownership generation N to N+1
  D-->>C: Transfer committed
  C->>N: Grant generation N+1 and checkpoint
  N->>N: Verify adapter/environment/artifacts
  N-->>C: Ready to continue
  O->>C: Late event from generation N
  C-->>O: Reject stale generation
  Note over O,N: Not arbitrary live process migration
